# Form blanks and their extractions live in object storage, never in the repo.
#
# A blank in git made adding a form — and every new USCIS edition of a form
# already catalogued — a deploy, which is the wall this whole tier moved to get
# past. See src/modules/workflow/form-blank-storage.ts. These entries exist so
# a local working copy, or the directory a `migrate-form-blanks --from` run is
# pointed at, cannot quietly be committed back in.
forms/
src/db/seeds/data/*.form-fields.json
src/db/seeds/data/*.field-sources.json
